        "size_soon_note": "",
        "shipping_accordion": "Complimentary shipping on orders over $150. Orders process within 24–48 hours and typically ship the next business day. Standard delivery 3–5 business days; express 1–2 business days available at checkout.",
        "returns_accordion": "Try them on for size — indoors only. 30 days from delivery if they're new and sellable. US return shipping $7.95. 90-day warranty covers manufacturing defects only.",
        "description_accordion_body": "Designed for Barre, Pilates, Reformer, Megaformer, Lagree, and Yoga. Both styles perform the same—Open Sole offers a more natural barefoot feel, while Closed Sole provides full coverage with the same grip and stability.\n\nSecond-skin feel. Ultra-light, flexible — more control than socks.\nNatural toe splay. Natural balance and control.\n\nPush confidently through deep lunges, Reformer flows, and Megaformer sequences.\n\nThe Closed Sole is heel and foot fully covered.\n\nOne pair. No more socks."
      }
